<title>JAPAN: Nihon Unisys - 6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Nihon Unisys - 6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		118.67		vs	  112.75</p>
<p> Operating	    3.05		vs	    3.69</p>
<p> Current		2.45		vs	    2.37</p>
<p> Net		  974    million    vs	    1.15</p>
<p> EPS		    8.88 yen	  vs	   10.53 yen</p>
<p> Shares	    110 million	  vs	 110 million</p>
<p> Interim div	  3.75 yen	  vs	    3.75 yen</p>
<p>NOTE - Nihon Unisys Ltd is a leading importer of computers.</p>
</text>
